title: Palo Alto: Licenses (XML API)
agents: palo_alto_api
catalog: hw/network/palo_alto
license: GPLv3
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check monitors the licenses installed on a Palo Alto Networks firewall as
 read from {request license info} through the PAN-OS XML API. For every license
 that has an expiration date the remaining validity in days is reported.

 The service goes {WARN} or {CRIT} when the remaining validity falls below the
 configured lower thresholds (default 30 / 14 days) or {CRIT} when the license
 has already expired. Licenses that never expire are reported as {OK}.

item:
 The license feature name.

discovery:
 One service is created for each installed license.
